<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia to privatise agriculture goods trading firm.</title>
<headline>Tunisia to privatise agriculture goods trading firm.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has launched a tender to sell a majority stake in Agricultor, a company which trades agriculture equipment, economic development ministry officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>Agricultor is a subsidiary of Al-Bouniane, a state-controlled capital goods trading firm, which is selling its 97.02 percent stake.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
